  Richard Williams Animation Survival Kit Illusion of Life

*** 1. Anticipation
    :PROPERTIES:
    :CUSTOM_ID: anticipation
    :END:

The Character thinks or plans out what they're going to do before doing
it

*** 2. Appeal
    :PROPERTIES:
    :CUSTOM_ID: appeal
    :END:

Design appeal

*** 3. Staging
    :PROPERTIES:
    :CUSTOM_ID: staging
    :END:

how the character is placed or staged for the audience to see them

*** 4. Pose to Pose and Straight Ahead
    :PROPERTIES:
    :CUSTOM_ID: pose-to-pose-and-straight-ahead
    :END:

1. Pose to Pose

   - Animating where you draw one pose and plan out the next pose and
     then animate the poses in between and plan them all out

2. Straight Ahead

   - Animating where you draw one pose after the next

*** 5. Slow in and Slow Out
    :PROPERTIES:
    :CUSTOM_ID: slow-in-and-slow-out
    :END:

- Slow in is zoom in where it slows in to the second drawing

Slow out drawings closer to the first drawing

